  <!-- ======================= VISION ======================= -->
  <section class="vision" id="vision">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The Vision</h2>

      <p>
        The Great Shift is a curated field, community, and design platform
        for people who recognize the civilizational transition now
        underway&mdash;and who feel called to help shape the structures,
        systems, and consciousness of what comes next.
      </p>

      <p>
        We gather conscious, high-capacity people into small, coherent
        circles where insight deepens, signal strengthens, and creation
        begins. The work moves through four stages:
      </p>

      <ol class="stages">
        <li><strong>Sense-making</strong> &mdash; understanding the transition and the forces reshaping reality</li>
        <li><strong>Coherence</strong> &mdash; building trust, alignment, and clarity in the relational field</li>
        <li><strong>Design</strong> &mdash; articulating the principles and blueprints of new systems</li>
        <li><strong>Manifestation</strong> &mdash; moving from insight to prototypes, initiatives, and institutions</li>
      </ol>

      <p>
        Circle by circle, domain by domain, these fields interconnect into a
        larger architecture of change&mdash;the scaffolding of an emergent
        civilization. The domains awaiting their architects:
      </p>

      <ul class="domains">
        <li>Governance &amp; civic order</li>
        <li>Economics &amp; wealth creation</li>
        <li>Health, wellness &amp; healing</li>
        <li>Education &amp; human development</li>
        <li>Environment &amp; planetary stewardship</li>
        <li>Science &amp; technology</li>
        <li>Spirituality &amp; consciousness</li>
        <li>Media &amp; communications</li>
        <li>Arts &amp; entertainment</li>
        <li>Law &amp; justice</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="vision-close">
        This is not a discussion forum. It is a place where vision becomes
        structure, insight becomes design, and the future begins to take form
        through conscious collaboration.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ======================= THE CALL ======================= -->
  <section class="call" id="community">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The Recognition</h2>

      <p>
        Some who read this page will find it interesting. A smaller number
        will find it <em>familiar</em>&mdash;like something remembered rather
        than learned.
      </p>

      <p>
        You may have carried it quietly your whole life: the sense of being
        made for a time that hadn't arrived yet. The inability to fully
        belong to systems you could already see through. A blueprint pressing
        at the edge of your awareness&mdash;of how governance could work, how
        healing could work, how abundance could flow&mdash;waiting for the
        conditions in which it could finally be built.
      </p>

      <p>
        The conditions have arrived. The old structures are coming down, the
        new ones are unformed, and the window in between belongs to those who
        came here to build. You are not late. You are not early. And you are
        not alone&mdash;the others are finding their way here too.
      </p>

      <p class="call-close">
        If these words land like memory, they were written for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

